  "label": "Single Motherhood Stereotype",
  "description": "A racist trope that falsely suggests Black children are only found in single-mother households, reinforcing the idea that Black families are inherently unstable. This stereotype is used in the meme to demean Black families and imply that Blackness is synonymous with single parenthood.",
